@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState --> ContentListState : Load Content List
ContentListState --> SearchState : Initiate Search
SearchState --> FilteredListState : Apply Search Filters
FilteredListState --> ContentListState : Clear Search
ContentListState --> AddItemState : Add New Item
AddItemState --> ContentListState : Item Added
ContentListState --> RemoveItemState : Remove Item
RemoveItemState --> ContentListState : Item Removed
ContentListState --> RearrangeItemState : Rearrange Items
RearrangeItemState --> ContentListState : Items Rearranged
ContentListState --> VoiceOverState : Enable VoiceOver
VoiceOverState --> ContentListState : Disable VoiceOver
ContentListState --> HighContrastState : Enable High Contrast
HighContrastState --> ContentListState : Disable High Contrast
ContentListState --> KeyboardNavState : Enable Keyboard Navigation
KeyboardNavState --> ContentListState : Disable Keyboard Navigation
ContentListState --> AccessibilityKeywordsState : Enable Keywords
AccessibilityKeywordsState --> ContentListState : Disable Keywords
ContentListState --> [*] : Exit Feature
@enduml
